---
interface Props {
  theme?: 'dark' | 'light';
  lang?: 'ru' | 'en';
}

const { theme = 'dark', lang = 'ru' } = Astro.props;
const isLight = theme === 'light';
const isEn = lang === 'en';
---

<section
  id="founder"
  aria-label={isEn ? 'About Yakov' : 'О Якове'}
  class:list={[
    'relative z-10 pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-32 md:pb-24 transition-colors duration-300',
    isLight ? 'text-[#1D1D1D]' : 'text-white',
  ]}
  style={
    isLight
      ? 'background: linear-gradient(to top, #F7F5F2 0%, rgba(247, 245, 242, 0.96) 20%, rgba(247, 245, 242, 0.8) 42%, rgba(247, 245, 242, 0.45) 68%, rgba(247, 245, 242, 0.15) 86%, transparent 100%);'
      : 'background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #181818 0%, #000000 100%);'
  }
>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[18.5rem] grid-cols-1 gap-y-8 items-center sm:max-w-none lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-x-[var(--grid-gap)]">
      <div class="lg:col-start-3 lg:col-span-3">
        <div
          class:list={[
            'relative aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-[11.5rem] sm:max-w-[26rem] mx-auto lg:mx-0 overflow-hidden',
            isLight ? 'bg-black/[0.04]' : 'bg-white/[0.04]',
          ]}
        >
          <img
            src="/cover.webp"
            alt={isEn ? 'Yakov Pilipyuk, designer' : 'Яков Пилипюк, дизайнер'}
            width="640"
            height="800"
            loading="lazy"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover grayscale-[15%] transition-all duration-500 hover:grayscale-0"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full text-center lg:col-start-7 lg:col-span-4 lg:text-left">
        <h2
          class:list={[
            'm-0 mb-6 text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)] font-normal leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.04em]',
            isLight ? 'text-[#1D1D1D]' : 'text-white',
          ]}
          style="font-family: var(--font-display);"
        >
          {isEn ? 'Yakov Pilipyuk' : 'Яков Пилипюк'}
        </h2>
        <p
          class:list={[
            'm-0 max-w-[42rem] text-[clamp(1rem,1.2vw,1.15rem)] leading-[1.4] text-pretty',
            isLight ? 'text-[#1D1D1D]/75' : 'text-white/80',
          ]}
        >
          {isEn ? (
            <>I believe great design begins with attention to detail, clarity, and what truly matters. For eight years, I have been translating ideas into tangible form: websites, identities, and print you want to hold in your hands. I handle every phase personally without dilution or handoffs.</>
          ) : (
            <>Верю, что хороший дизайн начинается с&nbsp;внимания к&nbsp;деталям, к&nbsp;смыслу, к&nbsp;тому, что действительно важно сказать. Восемь лет я&nbsp;превращаю идеи в&nbsp;форму: сайты, знаки, бумагу, которую хочется держать в&nbsp;руках. Не&nbsp;люблю разбивать проект на&nbsp;цеха и&nbsp;довожу всё сам.</>
          )}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
